    "detailed_description": "SPY SWATTER 2<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBad Dudes have stolen Top Secret Files and scattered them all over the World !<br />\r\nYou have to Travel to Cool Locations and Get The Bad Dudes, Get the Files and Save us ALL !<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTravel on Foot or By Car.<br />\r\nGo to Several Global Locations inspired by Los Angeles, London, and Tokyo !<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUse Different Weapons (Machine Gun, ShotGun, Rockets).<br />\r\nReload with AMMO found around the Map.<br />\r\nYou can also use Hand-to-Hand Combat !<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can drive any Car on the Map, including Your Top Secret Spy Car with Cool Deployable Gadgets like Machine Guns and Rockets !<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Game features procedurally generated Maps utilizing advanced Artificial intelligence for Optimization.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMake sure to try out 'Bullet Time' during Shoot-outs or Car Stunts for a Cool Effect !<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Game is Built with the GPU Melting Power of Unreal Engine 5 to create massive Cities to Explore with Extreme Levels of Detail.<br />\r\n** { Make Sure to have the Latest Graphics Drivers Installed } **<br />\r\n<br />\r\n#UnrealEngine5",
